  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: ${ }^n \\mathrm{C}_2-n=44$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{n(n-1)}{2}-n=44 \\\\\n& n\\left[\\frac{n-1}{2}-1\\right]=44 \\\\\n& n(n-3)=88 \\\\\n& n(n-3)=11 \\times 8 \\\\\n& n=11\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
